{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51451","headline":"李远获贵妃袜（各赋诗一首） · 李羣玉","name":"李远获贵妃袜（各赋诗一首）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故物存事渺茫，把来忍见旧时香。\n抝连绮锦分奇样，终合飞蝉饮瑞光。\n常束凝酥迷圣主，应随玉步浴温汤。\n如今落在吾兄手，无限幽情付本子郎。\n（《青琐高议前集》六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51451.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51451","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}